          "short": "$\\frac{4x^2}{25}-\\frac{9}{16}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\left(\\frac{2x}{5}+\\frac{3}{4}\\right)\\left(\\frac{2x}{5}-\\frac{3}{4}\\right)&=\\left(\\frac{2x}{5}\\right)^2-\\left(\\frac{3}{4}\\right)^2\\\\\\left(\\frac{2x}{5}+\\frac{3}{4}\\right)\\left(\\frac{2x}{5}-\\frac{3}{4}\\right)&=\\frac{4x^2}{25}-\\frac{9}{16}\\end{align*}$$",
